rule from scratch and could have made the same mistake; this is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the rule written once, in the type that exists to own it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An empty list is plural (“none of them are here”) and renders as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"empty phrase. No stock line calls one with nothing in it — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"callers all branch on empty first, with a line of their own — but a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game’s might, and silently reading as singular would be the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defect one case further out.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Several nouns as one — “a sword, a lamp, and some scales” — carrying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the number the whole phrase has rather than the number any one of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them has.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TextAndRandomness":{"abstract":[{"text":"Re-skin the engine’s stock lines, and roll dice that replay.","type":"text"}],"title":"Text and Randomness","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TextAndRandomness","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/textandrandomness","role":"article"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameText/Noun/list(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext\/noun\/list(_:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun\/list(_:)","title":"list(_:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"list","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":